      "proposed_content": "The logarithm or logarithmic derivative of the Euler product encodes primes through additive prime-power coefficients; Perron or Mellin inversion and contour residues expose poles and zeros in the associated weighted summatory function; Möbius inversion is a distinct final step when the target is primes rather than prime powers.",
